{"slug": "dieta-blanda", "wix": "about-6", "secciones": [{"h": 693, "bg": "rgb(255, 255, 255)", "bgImg": "", "items": [{"k": "caja", "x": 0, "y": 5, "w": 1440, "h": 687, "bg": "rgb(255, 255, 255)", "bimg": "", "rad": "0px", "borde": "", "id": 0, "padre": null}, {"k": "caja", "x": -9, "y": 5, "w": 529, "h": 686, "bg": "rgb(22, 59, 74)", "bimg": "", "rad": "0px", "borde": "", "id": 1, "padre": 0}, {"k": "img", "x": 16, "y": 179, "w": 600, "h": 400, "src": "/img/pollo-a-la-parrilla-con-arroz-y-perejil.webp", "alt": "Pollo a la parrilla con arroz y perejil.png", "fit": "cover", "rad": "0px", "id": 2, "padre": 1}, {"k": "texto", "x": 616, "y": 72, "w": 620, "h": 247, "html": "<h1 style=\"--f:56;line-height:1.23;color:rgb(49, 90, 107)\">Dieta blanda: ¿Qué puedo comer y qué debo evitar?</h1>", "fs": 56, "color": "rgb(49, 90, 107)", "align": "start", "id": 3, "padre": 0}, {"k": "texto", "x": 616, "y": 356, "w": 620, "h": 270, "html": "<p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">La dieta blanda es un tipo de alimentación que busca facilitar la digestión y disminuir las molestias gastrointestinales. </p><p class=\"vacio\" style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\"></p><p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">Puede recomendarse temporalmente en pacientes con gastritis, náuseas, diarrea o durante la recuperación de algunas enfermedades y procedimientos médicos.</p><p class=\"vacio\" style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\"></p><p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">Consiste en consumir alimentos de fácil digestión, preparados de manera sencilla, evitando aquellos que puedan provocar irritación o aumentar las molestias digestivas.</p>", "fs": 18, "color": "rgb(82, 79, 79)", "align": "start", "id": 4, "padre": 0}]}, {"h": 1264, "bg": "rgb(220, 232, 236)", "bgImg": "", "items": [{"k": "texto", "x": 258, "y": 87, "w": 907, "h": 69, "html": "<h2 style=\"--f:56;line-height:1.23;color:rgb(49, 90, 107)\">¿Qué alimentos puedo comer?</h2>", "fs": 56, "color": "rgb(49, 90, 107)", "align": "start", "id": 0, "padre": null}, {"k": "caja", "x": 40, "y": 242, "w": 1360, "h": 979, "bg": "rgb(255, 255, 255)", "bimg": "", "rad": "0px", "borde": "", "id": 1, "padre": null}, {"k": "texto", "x": 258, "y": 288, "w": 925, "h": 47, "html": "<h3 style=\"--f:26;color:rgb(38, 50, 56)\">Durante una dieta blanda generalmente se recomiendan:</h3>", "fs": 26, "color": "rgb(38, 50, 56)", "align": "start", "id": 2, "padre": 1}, {"k": "img", "x": -49, "y": 404, "w": 398, "h": 266, "src": "/img/plato-de-platano-y-manzana-cocidos.webp", "alt": "Plato de plátano y manzana cocidos.png", "fit": "cover", "rad": "0px", "id": 3, "padre": 1}, {"k": "texto", "x": 374, "y": 415, "w": 233, "h": 25, "html": "<h4 style=\"--f:22;color:rgb(184, 155, 106)\">Carnes</h4>", "fs": 22, "color": "rgb(160, 121, 109)", "align": "start", "id": 4, "padre": 1}, {"k": "texto", "x": 374, "y": 556, "w": 233, "h": 25, "html": "<h4 style=\"--f:22;color:rgb(184, 155, 106)\">Cereales</h4>", "fs": 22, "color": "rgb(160, 121, 109)", "align": "start", "id": 5, "padre": 1}, {"k": "texto", "x": 650, "y": 415, "w": 499, "h": 107, "html": "<p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">Pollo sin piel</p><p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">Pescado cocido, hervido o a la plancha</p><p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">Pavo cocido, hervido o a la plancha</p>", "fs": 18, "color": "rgb(82, 79, 79)", "align": "start", "id": 6, "padre": 1}, {"k": "texto", "x": 650, "y": 556, "w": 499, "h": 116, "html": "<p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">Arroz blanco</p><p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">Pasta sencilla</p><p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">Pan blanco</p><p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">Galletas saladas</p>", "fs": 18, "color": "rgb(82, 79, 79)", "align": "start", "id": 7, "padre": 1}, {"k": "texto", "x": 374, "y": 720, "w": 233, "h": 25, "html": "<h4 style=\"--f:22;color:rgb(184, 155, 106)\">Verduras</h4>", "fs": 22, "color": "rgb(160, 121, 109)", "align": "start", "id": 8, "padre": 1}, {"k": "texto", "x": 374, "y": 929, "w": 233, "h": 25, "html": "<h4 style=\"--f:22;color:rgb(184, 155, 106)\">Sopas</h4>", "fs": 22, "color": "rgb(160, 121, 109)", "align": "start", "id": 9, "padre": 1}, {"k": "texto", "x": 650, "y": 715, "w": 499, "h": 174, "html": "<p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">Zanahoria</p><p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">Calabaza</p><p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">Chayote</p><p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">Papa </p><p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">*preferentemente cocidos y </p><p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">sin cáscara</p>", "fs": 18, "color": "rgb(82, 79, 79)", "align": "start", "id": 10, "padre": 1}, {"k": "img", "x": 947, "y": 691, "w": 413, "h": 275, "src": "/img/plato-de-verduras-al-vapor-coloridas.webp", "alt": "Plato de verduras al vapor coloridas.png", "fit": "cover", "rad": "0px", "id": 11, "padre": 1}, {"k": "texto", "x": 650, "y": 929, "w": 499, "h": 105, "html": "<p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">Caldos desgrasados</p><p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">Sopa de verduras cocidas</p><p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">Sopa de arroz</p>", "fs": 18, "color": "rgb(82, 79, 79)", "align": "start", "id": 12, "padre": 1}, {"k": "texto", "x": 374, "y": 1090, "w": 233, "h": 25, "html": "<h4 style=\"--f:22;color:rgb(184, 155, 106)\">Bebidas</h4>", "fs": 22, "color": "rgb(160, 121, 109)", "align": "start", "id": 13, "padre": 1}, {"k": "texto", "x": 650, "y": 1090, "w": 499, "h": 105, "html": "<p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">Agua natural</p><p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">Soluciones de rehidratación oral (cuando estén indicadas)</p>", "fs": 18, "color": "rgb(82, 79, 79)", "align": "start", "id": 14, "padre": 1}]}, {"h": 1313, "bg": "rgb(220, 232, 236)", "bgImg": "", "items": [{"k": "texto", "x": 258, "y": 36, "w": 907, "h": 69, "html": "<h2 style=\"--f:56;line-height:1.23;color:rgb(49, 90, 107)\">¿Qué alimentos debo evitar?</h2>", "fs": 56, "color": "rgb(49, 90, 107)", "align": "start", "id": 0, "padre": null}, {"k": "caja", "x": 40, "y": 176, "w": 1360, "h": 1083, "bg": "rgb(255, 255, 255)", "bimg": "", "rad": "0px", "borde": "", "id": 1, "padre": null}, {"k": "texto", "x": 245, "y": 236, "w": 925, "h": 47, "html": "<p style=\"--f:26;color:rgb(38, 50, 56)\">Durante el período de dieta blanda es recomendable evitar:</p>", "fs": 26, "color": "rgb(38, 50, 56)", "align": "start", "id": 2, "padre": 1}, {"k": "texto", "x": 245, "y": 350, "w": 233, "h": 50, "html": "<h4 style=\"--f:22;color:rgb(184, 155, 106)\">Comidas fritas o muy grasosas</h4>", "fs": 22, "color": "rgb(160, 121, 109)", "align": "start", "id": 3, "padre": 1}, {"k": "texto", "x": 245, "y": 450, "w": 233, "h": 50, "html": "<h4 style=\"--f:22;color:rgb(184, 155, 106)\">Chiles, salsas picantes, aderezos irritantes</h4>", "fs": 22, "color": "rgb(160, 121, 109)", "align": "start", "id": 4, "padre": 1}, {"k": "texto", "x": 245, "y": 554, "w": 233, "h": 75, "html": "<h4 style=\"--f:22;color:rgb(184, 155, 106)\">Comida rápida y alimentos ultraprocesados</h4>", "fs": 22, "color": "rgb(160, 121, 109)", "align": "start", "id": 5, "padre": 1}, {"k": "texto", "x": 613, "y": 350, "w": 233, "h": 50, "html": "<h4 style=\"--f:22;color:rgb(184, 155, 106)\">Alimentos muy condimentados</h4>", "fs": 22, "color": "rgb(160, 121, 109)", "align": "start", "id": 6, "padre": 1}, {"k": "texto", "x": 613, "y": 450, "w": 233, "h": 50, "html": "<h4 style=\"--f:22;color:rgb(184, 155, 106)\">Embutidos y carnes muy grasosas</h4>", "fs": 22, "color": "rgb(160, 121, 109)", "align": "start", "id": 7, "padre": 1}, {"k": "texto", "x": 613, "y": 554, "w": 233, "h": 75, "html": "<h4 style=\"--f:22;color:rgb(184, 155, 106)\">Alimentos que te produzcan distensión o gases</h4>", "fs": 22, "color": "rgb(160, 121, 109)", "align": "start", "id": 8, "padre": 1}, {"k": "img", "x": 926, "y": 441, "w": 425, "h": 284, "src": "/img/mole-poblano-con-pollo-y-arroz.webp", "alt": "Mole poblano con pollo y arroz.png", "fit": "cover", "rad": "0px", "id": 9, "padre": 1}, {"k": "texto", "x": 245, "y": 736, "w": 338, "h": 47, "html": "<p style=\"--f:26;color:rgb(38, 50, 56)\">Bebidas que debes evitar</p>", "fs": 26, "color": "rgb(38, 50, 56)", "align": "start", "id": 10, "padre": 1}, {"k": "texto", "x": 603, "y": 853, "w": 233, "h": 25, "html": "<h4 style=\"--f:22;color:rgb(184, 155, 106)\">Bebidas alcohólicas</h4>", "fs": 22, "color": "rgb(160, 121, 109)", "align": "start", "id": 11, "padre": 1}, {"k": "texto", "x": 954, "y": 853, "w": 233, "h": 25, "html": "<h4 style=\"--f:22;color:rgb(184, 155, 106)\">Café</h4>", "fs": 22, "color": "rgb(160, 121, 109)", "align": "start", "id": 12, "padre": 1}, {"k": "img", "x": 245, "y": 890, "w": 311, "h": 208, "src": "/img/taza-de-cafe-negro-humeante.webp", "alt": "Taza de café negro humeante.png", "fit": "cover", "rad": "0px", "id": 13, "padre": 1}, {"k": "texto", "x": 603, "y": 981, "w": 233, "h": 50, "html": "<h4 style=\"--f:22;color:rgb(184, 155, 106)\">Refrescos y bebidas gaseosas</h4>", "fs": 22, "color": "rgb(160, 121, 109)", "align": "start", "id": 14, "padre": 1}, {"k": "texto", "x": 954, "y": 981, "w": 233, "h": 25, "html": "<h4 style=\"--f:22;color:rgb(184, 155, 106)\">Bebidas energéticas</h4>", "fs": 22, "color": "rgb(160, 121, 109)", "align": "start", "id": 15, "padre": 1}, {"k": "texto", "x": 603, "y": 1127, "w": 233, "h": 25, "html": "<h4 style=\"--f:22;color:rgb(184, 155, 106)\">Jugos cítricos</h4>", "fs": 22, "color": "rgb(160, 121, 109)", "align": "start", "id": 16, "padre": 1}, {"k": "texto", "x": 954, "y": 1127, "w": 233, "h": 50, "html": "<h4 style=\"--f:22;color:rgb(184, 155, 106)\">Bebidas muy azucaradas</h4>", "fs": 22, "color": "rgb(160, 121, 109)", "align": "start", "id": 17, "padre": 1}]}, {"h": 438, "bg": "rgb(255, 255, 255)", "bgImg": "", "items": [{"k": "texto", "x": 258, "y": 61, "w": 795, "h": 69, "html": "<h2 style=\"--f:56;line-height:1.23;color:rgb(49, 90, 107)\">Recomendaciones generales</h2>", "fs": 56, "color": "rgb(49, 90, 107)", "align": "start", "id": 0, "padre": null}, {"k": "texto", "x": 258, "y": 175, "w": 757, "h": 214, "html": "<ul><li style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">Come porciones pequeñas varias veces al día.</li><li style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">Mastica despacio y evita comer en exceso.</li><li style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">Prefiere alimentos hervidos, al vapor, horneados o a la plancha.</li><li style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">Mantén una adecuada hidratación.</li><li style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">Evita acostarte inmediatamente después de comer.</li><li style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">Introduce gradualmente otros alimentos conforme mejores y siguiendo las indicaciones de tu médico.</li></ul>", "fs": 18, "color": "rgb(82, 79, 79)", "align": "start", "id": 1, "padre": null}]}, {"h": 261, "bg": "rgb(160, 121, 109)", "bgImg": "", "items": [{"k": "caja", "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 576, "h": 261, "bg": "rgb(49, 90, 107)", "bimg": "", "rad": "0px", "borde": "", "id": 0, "padre": null}, {"k": "texto", "x": 108, "y": 55, "w": 373, "h": 131, "html": "<h2 style=\"--f:33;color:rgb(249, 240, 232)\">¿Cuánto tiempo debo seguir una dieta blanda?</h2>", "fs": 33, "color": "rgb(160, 121, 109)", "align": "start", "id": 1, "padre": 0}, {"k": "caja", "x": 576, "y": 0, "w": 864, "h": 261, "bg": "rgb(220, 232, 236)", "bimg": "", "rad": "0px", "borde": "", "id": 2, "padre": null}, {"k": "texto", "x": 721, "y": 49, "w": 574, "h": 163, "html": "<p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">La duración depende del motivo por el cual fue indicada y de tu evolución.</p><p class=\"vacio\" style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\"></p><p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">Generalmente se utiliza de manera temporal. No es necesario mantener una alimentación restrictiva durante periodos prolongados sin indicación médica.</p>", "fs": 18, "color": "rgb(82, 79, 79)", "align": "start", "id": 3, "padre": 2}]}, {"h": 371, "bg": "rgb(249, 240, 232)", "bgImg": "", "items": [{"k": "caja", "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 1440, "h": 371, "bg": "rgb(255, 255, 255)", "bimg": "", "rad": "0px", "borde": "", "id": 0, "padre": null}, {"k": "texto", "x": 268, "y": 51, "w": 879, "h": 32, "html": "<p style=\"--f:26;color:rgb(184, 155, 106)\">Importante</p>", "fs": 26, "color": "rgb(184, 155, 106)", "align": "start", "id": 1, "padre": 0}, {"k": "linea", "x": 276, "y": 106, "w": 89, "h": 5, "color": "rgb(160, 121, 109)", "id": 2, "padre": 0}, {"k": "texto", "x": 276, "y": 135, "w": 879, "h": 100, "html": "<p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(82, 79, 79)\">Estas recomendaciones son generales. La alimentación puede variar según tu enfermedad, el procedimiento realizado y tus necesidades individuales. Si presentas vómitos persistentes, dolor abdominal intenso o dificultad para tolerar alimentos y líquidos, solicita valoración médica.</p>", "fs": 18, "color": "rgb(82, 79, 79)", "align": "start", "id": 3, "padre": 0}, {"k": "btn", "x": 533, "y": 244, "w": 374, "h": 133, "t": "Agenda tu cita hoy", "href": "https://wa.me/529999566388", "tipo": "cita", "id": 4, "padre": 0}]}, {"h": 503, "bg": "rgb(220, 232, 236)", "bgImg": "", "items": [{"k": "caja", "x": 80, "y": 0, "w": 1280, "h": 472, "bg": "rgb(23, 59, 74)", "bimg": "", "rad": "0px", "borde": "", "id": 0, "padre": null}, {"k": "caja", "x": 230, "y": 67, "w": 980, "h": 342, "bg": "rgb(255, 255, 255)", "bimg": "", "rad": "0px", "borde": "", "id": 1, "padre": 0}, {"k": "texto", "x": 268, "y": 80, "w": 895, "h": 322, "html": "<p style=\"--f:26;color:rgb(38, 50, 56)\">Elaboración y colaboración profesional</p><p class=\"vacio\" style=\"--f:26;color:rgb(38, 50, 56)\"></p><p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(38, 50, 56)\">Estas guías de alimentación fueron elaboradas en colaboración con Lucía González Ramírez, </p><p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(38, 50, 56)\">Doctora en Nutrición y Ciencias de la Salud, con el objetivo de proporcionar información clara, práctica y fundamentada para orientar a los pacientes en su alimentación.</p><p class=\"vacio\" style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(38, 50, 56)\"></p><p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(38, 50, 56)\">Para obtener mayor información, recibir asesoría nutricional o solicitar un plan de alimentación individualizado, puedes comunicarte directamente con ella:</p><p class=\"vacio\" style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(38, 50, 56)\"></p><p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(38, 50, 56)\">Teléfono / WhatsApp: 9992 232188</p><p style=\"--f:18;color:rgb(38, 50, 56)\">Correo electrónico: <a href=\"mailto:nutclinica@outlook.com\">nutclinica@outlook.com</a></p>", "fs": 26, "color": "rgb(38, 50, 56)", "align": "start", "id": 2, "padre": 1}]}]}